<LegalLayout title="Privacy policy" path="/privacy/" updated="September 2026" description="How Aquam Fitness collects, uses and protects personal information submitted through this website.">
  <p>Aquam Fitness ("we", "us") respects your privacy. This policy explains what personal information we collect through aqfitness.ca, why we collect it and how we protect it, in line with Canada's Personal Information Protection and Electronic Documents Act (PIPEDA).</p>
  <h2>What we collect</h2>
  <ul>
    <li><strong>Contact form:</strong> your name, email, optional phone number, company and team size (if you ask about Aquam Performance) and your message.</li>
    <li><strong>Newsletter and free guide:</strong> your email address and, for the guide, your first name.</li>
    <li><strong>Booking a call:</strong> the details you enter in our scheduling tool.</li>
  </ul>
  <p>We don't use advertising trackers or sell personal information.</p>
  <h2>How we use it</h2>
  <p>To reply to your message, schedule calls, send the guide and newsletter you asked for, and provide coaching if you become a client. You can unsubscribe from emails at any time using the link in every email.</p>
  <h2>Service providers</h2>
  <p>We use trusted providers to run this website and our communications: Netlify (website hosting and form submissions), Resend (email delivery), Calendly (call scheduling) and Zoom (video calls). They process information on our behalf and may store it outside Canada.</p>
  <h2>Retention and security</h2>
  <p>We keep personal information only as long as needed for the purposes above, and protect it with reasonable safeguards.</p>
  <h2>Your rights</h2>
  <p>You can ask to see, correct or delete the personal information we hold about you. Contact us through the <a href="/contact/">contact page</a>.</p>
</LegalLayout>
